# Butler Routes - Mount Hyjal (Horde) completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Horde accept in the local census (13 quests, docs/mount-hyjal-horde-census.md,
# key 2482, band 54-60) appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin.
# No soft-pre minis: every blocking pre is in-contract (92609, 96616, 96998,
# the four summit pres) or main-contracted shared (95316, chain note at the
# Crow). The Durotar turn-in (96999 to Tai'tasi) rides a deliberate expedition
# leg. Sourceless objectives (Silphium, Stag Sliders) ride bag notes, never
# invented completes.
guide butler-routes-completionist/mount-hyjal-horde
title Mount Hyjal (Horde)
levels 54-60
zone Mount Hyjal
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Kalimdor
coords live
version 1

step Western post - the chain heads

  zone map 2482

  tip Kal'tinzan (13.77, 53.06), Zet'gan (13.82, 54.75) and Ortak Lomgok (12.93, 52.85) hold the western post, shoulder to shoulder.
  accept 91794 -- Flags of Our Forebears - Kal'tinzan; the Horde Flag has no placed source in the data - it rides with the heraldry crews below
  accept 92592 -- Final Death - Zet'gan; a Reanimator's Amulet off the Scourge Reanimators west
  accept 92609 -- Feathers in Flight - Zet'gan; nine Hyjal Owl Feathers off the owls west
  accept 95026 -- Blight No More - Zet'gan; Forgotten Soldiers and Fleshflay Raveners in the west fields
  accept 96616 -- Herbs for the Bruised and Weary - Ortak Lomgok; the Hyjal Silphium has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags
  accept 97119 -- Now We're Cooking - Ortak Lomgok; the Savory Stag Sliders have no source anywhere in the data - have them in your bags

step The west fields - flags, feathers, amulets, blight

  zone map 2482

  complete 91794 @43.89,32.63 -- Scrap of Horde Heraldry off the Felguard Sentinels, demon front
  complete 91794 @49.33,32.45 -- more heraldry off the Doomguards, demon front east
  complete 92592 @22.69,47.54 -- a Reanimator's Amulet off the Scourge Reanimators, west fields
  complete 92609 @18.98,60.98 -- Hyjal Owl Feathers off the owls, west
  complete 92609 @26.25,65.29 -- more feathers, north-west
  complete 95026 @18.0,60.38 -- Forgotten Soldiers, west fields
  complete 95026 @23.09,51.75 -- Fleshflay Raveners, west fields
  turnin 91794 -- Flags of Our Forebears - the flag and heraldry to Kal'tinzan
  turnin 92592 -- Final Death - the amulet to Zet'gan
  turnin 92609 -- Feathers in Flight - the feathers to Zet'gan
  turnin 95026 -- Blight No More - the count to Zet'gan
  turnin 96616 -- Herbs for the Bruised and Weary - the word to Ortak Lomgok
  turnin 97119 -- Now We're Cooking - the word to Ortak Lomgok
  accept 92446 -- Head Scratcher - Zet'gan; the Scratchers come off the Head Scratchers south
  accept 96622 -- A Rest Without Pain - Ortak Lomgok; the word stays at the post

step The south camp - scratchers and rest

  zone map 2482

  complete 92446 @33.82,72.86 -- Head Scratcher's Scratchers off the Head Scratchers, south camp
  complete 92446 @36.02,73.39 -- more Scratchers, south camp east
  turnin 92446 -- Head Scratcher - the Scratchers to Zet'gan
  turnin 96622 -- A Rest Without Pain - the word to Ortak Lomgok

step Elder grove - the Crow's post

  zone map 2482

  tip The Curious Crow waits at (48.26, 85.72) in the elder grove, far north-east.
  note 95316 (The Experimental Method) is contracted in the main Mount Hyjal guide - bring it done from the elder-grove leg there; this guide does not re-route it.
  accept 94782 -- The Western Post - the Curious Crow; the word goes back to Zet'gan

step Troll Remains - tribal colors

  zone map 2482

  accept 96998 -- Tribal Colors - the Troll Remains; the word goes to Zet'gan
  turnin 96998 -- Tribal Colors - the word to Zet'gan
  accept 96999 -- Wrap Return - Zet'gan; the word goes to Tai'tasi in Durotar (expedition below)

step Far east - Thark Gorax

  zone map 2482

  tip Thark Gorax holds his single point at (79.94, 70.69), far east.
  accept 96830 -- Farsight Guided - Thark Gorax; the word goes back west to Ortak
  turnin 96830 -- Farsight Guided - the word to Ortak Lomgok

step The summit - eternity

  zone map 2482

  turnin 94782 -- The Western Post - the word to Zet'gan
  accept 95248 -- To the Summit of Eternity - Zet'gan; the word goes to Thisalee Crow at the summit
  turnin 95248 -- To the Summit of Eternity - the word to Thisalee Crow @68.99,49.99 era

